  "method": "Anonymous socketpairs enter the established-stream path on each actual Swift owner queue at release. Real reads, writes, kqueue delivery, backpressure, worker merge and lease JSON. A fabricated oversized readiness snapshot also drives a 17-byte read and an empty retry. Port 4002 has two workers, 4000 one inline owner, and 4001 disables profiling. Port 4003 exercises sparse and dense flat polls, budget-limited returns, unclassified reads and a final read with EOF. Fixture counts describe the controlled offers only.",
